dialog:0:0:0:0:0:0:Disclaimer; This map was originally written for another game moddified by Kannadiga..= Hail, and well met, traveler.=I am thankful that someone of your caliber has decided to visit my forest.=My name is Titania, Queen of the Pixies, and I am in desperate need of your help.=You see, my pixie subjects, they are very mischievous and playful beings.=They have decided to take my wand, and break it into five fragments.=All five of my wand fragments are scattered throughout my forest.=If you would do me a huge favor and go look for them, you can find me in my palace at the top of the tallest tree in the forest.=Your help for me is sincerely appreciated.
