dialog:0:0:0:0:30:30:Hail and well met, yet again, traveler to my domain.=You have found the fragments of my wand, but we pixies are mischievous beings.=I will not make it easy for you to bring the fragments to me.=But do understand, if you can pass my tests, the reward will be well worth it.=Can you reach my throne room?=Or will you die trying?=Will you claim the prestigious honor of being called Pixie Friend?=Or will you wallow in despair, trying to make it out of my dungeon?=That is for you to decide, traveler.=So far, my pixies and I have made it relatively easy for you to make your way here.=But be forewarned, traveler, the challenge becomes much more dangerous from here on out.=Good Luck.
