dialog:0:0:0:0:55:55:Welcome to my throne room, traveler.=You are well on your way to claiming the prestigious honor of being called Pixie Friend.=However, you are not yet out of danger.=Can you make it to the dais where my throne sits, to claim your reward?=Or will you be forever ensnared here, wallowing in your own despair?=The choice, as always, is yours, traveler.=Good luck.
