igdoor:50:50:50:50:97:97:40:40:100:Congratulations, traveler!  You have proven your worth, and have claimed the prestigious honor of being called a friend to the pixies.  Please, take this small token of 50 credits as a bonus reward.  You are welcome back to the Pixie Forest any time you like.:credit:50:500:silence.ogg:tp14.ogg:silence.ogg:silence.ogg
